      "title": "The crossover law, confirmed at the hard end",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "An advanced component is mostly judgment work; Scaffy's win concentrates in the mechanical fraction \u2014 the 8-site registration web (registry, dispatch, CASES, count pins, typekeyed partition, golden mirrors, completeness, tier) which the bare arm hunted by hand. That fraction \u224820% of the job, and Scaffy saved almost exactly that: \u221220% time, \u221220% tokens, correctness equal \u2014 with determinism and amortization the single run can't show. The duel also surfaced the SIXTH count-sync site (toPlainText typekeyed pins), banked on the flagship's amendment task."
        }
      ]
